{"id":"00262","root":"uni00262_1","name":{"ja":"上原　鹿之助","en":"Uehara Shikanosuke"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"上原　鹿之助","en":"Uehara Shikanosuke"},"aliases":["Uehara Kanosuke"],"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-11-25","limited":true,"characterId":192,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍の一人で、五車学園の学生。“電輝の対魔忍”として勇名を馳せる上原燐（うえはらりん）を従姉に持つ、電遁の術使い。上原家は井河や甲河には及ばないながら、上忍の家として代々続く名家である。電遁の術は文字だけ見ると派手な忍法のようだが、雷を操る“雷”遁の術とはまったく違い、生命体に存在する僅かな電気を操るのが主体の忍法で、その力は冬場の静電気程度といわれる。電気に対しては耐性があるため、最も向いている任務は電気工事だと揶揄される始末。おおよそ戦闘向きの忍法ではないとされ、少なくとも本人はそう自覚している。武器として手裏剣も使うが、彼は体も小さく、戦闘能力は対魔忍の中でも最下層に位置する。しかしその正義の心は熱く、いざとなれば生命と引き換えにしてでも正義を貫こうとする強い意思を持っている。……逃走したり号泣しながらではあるが。","en":"A Taimanin and student at Gosha Academy. He is the cousin of Uehara Rin, the \"Electric-Shining Taimanin\" famed for her bravery, and he uses electric-style ninjutsu. The Uehara family, while not as prominent as the Iga or Kouga clans, has long been a distinguished upper-rank ninja house. His electric ninjutsu may sound flashy in writing, but unlike \"Lightning\" style that manipulates thunder, it primarily controls the minute electrical currents that exist within living beings, producing power comparable to static electricity in winter. Because he has a resistance to electricity, he is often teased as being best suited for electrical work rather than combat. He acknowledges that his ninjutsu is hardly combat-oriented. He also employs shuriken, but his small stature and limited combat ability place him among the lowest-ranked Taimanin. Nevertheless, his sense of justice burns hot, and he is willing to sacrifice his life to uphold it—though he may end up fleeing or sobbing in the process."},"illustrator":"おぶい","voiceActor":"星もえる","forms":[{"id":"uni00262_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1382,2764],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[201,402],"def":[151,302],"spd":[88,88],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","390005"]},{"id":"uni00262_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1964,3928],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[302,604],"def":[202,404],"spd":[88,88],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","390005","390006"]},{"id":"uni00262_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2546,5137],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[403,808],"def":[253,502],"spd":[88,88],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["2","390005","390006","390007"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"}]},"390005":{"slot":"skill1","id":390005,"name":{"ja":"電遁の術“スパーク”"},"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":2,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":4,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":5,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵全体に極小威力で攻撃、中確率で麻痺状態にする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"All enemies: 107% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"All enemies: 30% chance to inflict Paralysis for 2 turns","icon":"paralysis","tag":"ailment","ref":"ab:2"}]},"390006":{"slot":"skill2","id":390006,"name":{"ja":"電遁の術“マルチスパーク”"},"hits":3,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、自身のSPを超特大回復する"}},{"level":2,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、自身のSPを超特大回復する"}},{"level":3,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、自身のSPを超特大回復する"}},{"level":4,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に大威力で攻撃、自身のSPを超特大回復する"}},{"level":5,"sp":250,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身のSPを超特大回復する"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 500% Devilish damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"Self: restore 100 SP","icon":"Healing_sp","tag":"instant"}]},"390007":{"slot":"ultimate","id":390007,