00262_1/uni00262_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"うう……強い人ばかりじゃないか、なんでお前緊張してないんだよ","en":"Ugh... everyone's so strong, why aren't you nervous?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00262_1/uni00262_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"今のうちに筋トレして、少しでも強くなっておこうかな……まずは腕立てから","en":"I should do some strength training while I can, get a bit stronger... starting with push-ups."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00262_1/uni00262_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"お、俺の方は準備万端だ！　いつでも行けるぜ！","en":"I'm all set! I can go anytime!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00262_1/uni00262_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"正義の対魔忍、ここに推参！　ちがうなあ……って、うわ！？　いつから見てた！？","en":"Justice Taimanin, reporting here! Wait, no... whoa! Since when have you been watching!?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00262_1/uni00262_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"この部隊って色んな奴らがいるなあ……俺、不安になってきた","en":"This squad's got all kinds of people... I'm starting to feel uneasy."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00262_1/uni00262_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00262_1/uni00262_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00262_1/uni00262_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00262_1/uni00262_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00262_1/uni00262_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00262_1/uni00262_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00262_1/uni00262_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"te